source_location=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-debian-rurema/3717a77b-67d6-4a40-b15e-a41ca141ab34/scratchpad/frozen.Phg2K5/src/refm/api/src/socket/constants

--- NI_DGRAM -> Integer
The service specified is a datagram service (looks up UDP ports)。

[[m:Socket.getnameinfo]], [[m:Addrinfo#getnameinfo]] の引数 flags に渡す
定数です。

  require 'socket'
  
  Socket.getnameinfo([ Socket::AF_INET, 514, "127.0.0.1"], Socket::NI_DGRAM)
  # => ["localhost", "syslog"]
  Socket.getnameinfo([ Socket::AF_INET, 514, "127.0.0.1"])
  # => ["localhost", "shell"]

@see [[man:getnameinfo(3)]]

